[{"title":"醉蓬莱 寿察判","author":"熊以宁","text":"渐荷收绿盖，桂吐金英，嫩凉天气。\n香案仙官，向人间游戏。\n道貌孤高，灵扃恬淡，有寿星标致。\n梦得文章，水心谈论，家声相继。\n芙蓉上幕，龙藩胜地。\n剡荐交飞，宸衷简记。\n行趣朝班，便鸾坡螭陛。\n赞画堂中，垂弧节届，且举觞一醉。\n试问庄椿，春秋多少，八千馀岁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27747,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 寿熊尚友","author":"熊可量","text":"清晓南窗笑语喧。\n今朝生日胜从前。\n鹤吞沆瀣神逾爽，松饱风霜节更坚。\n调气马，殖心田。\n几曾佞佛与夸仙。\n戏衫脱了浑无累，快活人间百十年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27748,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝中措 寿刘仲吉","author":"熊节","text":"麒麟早贵挂朝冠。\n自合侍金銮。\n收拾经纶事业，从容游戏人间。\n祗今侍彩，符分楚甸，名在蓬山。\n直待疏封大国，秋光长映朱颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27749,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题汪水云诗卷","author":"熊仲允","text":"轻轻漠漠暮云低，枯木寒枝宿鸟稀。\n古殿荒凉残日照，孤城寂寞故山围。\n十年波浪家何在，万里关河客未归。\n惆怅西湖湖上路，梅花如旧世相违。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27750,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满庭芳 郭县尹美任","author":"熊则轩","text":"波有颓澜，渴无冷镬，谁言制邑为难。\n汾阳善政，只在笑谈间。\n三载刑清讼简，官事辨、俗阜民安。\n帘垂昼，焚香宴坐，犹得半清闲。\n西风，催入觐，声驰当道，名达朝端。\n任锦溪溪上，卧辙攀辕。\n从此燕辕北去，好官样、留与人看。\n扁舟稳，图书外，惟有月俱还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27751,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石䂬","author":"熊邦彦","text":"万壑云霾凝不消，横空突起老龙腰。\n虚皇未放拿云去，留与金仙作石桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27752,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农十首 其十","author":"熊克","text":"唆伊争讼真伊贼，劝你休和是你师。\n纵使胜来耕已废，得便宜处失便宜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27753,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农十首 其九","author":"熊克","text":"腊时得雪喜重重，春到而今雨又通。\n麦自十分堪指拟，更当力穑顺年丰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27754,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农十首 其八","author":"熊克","text":"蚕月农须雨及时，三眠才起食嫌迟。\n采桑风雨无辞苦，指日缫成白雪丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27755,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农十首 其七","author":"熊克","text":"午村茅舍起炊烟，夫带儿耕馁在田。\n赤饭黄羹须妇馌，往来莫惮走东阡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27756,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农十首 其六","author":"熊克","text":"黄岩出谷半丹邱，使指新疏万壑流。\n筑堰未妨齐著力，旱天随取灌高畴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27757,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农十首 其五","author":"熊克","text":"己田自种乐为农，不肯勤耕奉主翁。\n劝汝回心毋见错，秋成获利两家同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27758,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农十首 其四","author":"熊克","text":"凡农主客两相依，以富资贫政所宜。\n要彼力耕吾有望，借粮借种莫迟迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27759,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农十首 其三","author":"熊克","text":"百昌萌动戴芒芽，小廪先储种自嘉。\n天暖地腴当亟播，好蠲甲谷润田家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27760,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农十首 其二","author":"熊克","text":"低田傍海仰依山，雨即横流旱即乾。\n时决时潴能自力，转成沃壤不为难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27761,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农十首 其一","author":"熊克","text":"雪渍冰濡土脉肥，趁时举趾莫教违。\n荷蓑早合冲烟去，负耒迟须带月归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27762,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿芮秘书三首 其三","author":"熊克","text":"册府都无未见书，毫端万斛泻明珠。\n若为池上星辰履，谩与瀛洲作画图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27763,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿芮秘书三首 其二","author":"熊克","text":"归来未对小延英，便向蓬莱作主人。\n要督仙宫雠玉籍，却收众妙入经纶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27764,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿芮秘书三首 其一","author":"熊克","text":"帝调玉烛召春还，仙袂同时度九关。\n万品欲沾何处得，东风今起道家山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27765,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访艮斋先生讲学之所","author":"熊克","text":"克斋从学艮斋地，溪友幸从诗友游。\n泉响如闻读书韵，山容犹带济时忧。\n呜呼道在人何在，籍甚名留迹不留。\n欲揖高风宁复得，归欤□□□抔□。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27766,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"葛仙山","author":"熊克","text":"秋风吹我衣，秋水洗我心。\n乘风直上葛仙顶，仙家楼阁烟霞深。\n蓬莱何曾弱水隔，兜率有天才咫尺。\n等闲拍手倚阑干，惊起蛟龙移窟泽。\n试剑石老苍苔封，洗药池在丹砂红。\n老仙骑鹤去未还，投崖何处寻遗踪。\n霏霏濛濛天欲霜，神州万里何茫茫。\n昆明水浅劫灰冷，几见东海成田桑。\n洞箫吹断月满堂，梦中恍惚侍玉皇。\n觉来两袖携天香，是非忧乐俱两忘。\n骖骐麟，翳凤凰，得与尔，高翱翔。\n仙翁一笑白云上，赠我长房青竹杖。\n明朝去向葛溪滨，莫遣风雷惊世人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27767,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"韩魏公读书堂","author":"游酢","text":"去郡五里安国寺，断蓬荒蓧成邱墟。\n郡人不置瓜李嫌，公亦甘与泉石居。\n想憎俗事败人意，独愿灯火勤三馀。\n今人不出如处女，陋室暗屋蹠不如。\n闻君读书胡乃尔，政恐心地怠芟锄。\n前辈浑厚应有此，难弟难兄俱可书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27768,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"熊岑","text":"溪藤频得句，雪舫夜留宾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27769,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过多福寺次王龟龄壁间韵","author":"熊应亨","text":"七尺枯藤手自摩，閒过僧寺坐横坡。\n花开曲径霜前密，云压层城雨后多。\n田舍竹林分鹫岭，山城芦水漾鱼波。\n禅床处处堆黄叶，独剩寒松不改柯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27770,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠王山人","author":"熊知至","text":"闲拄瘦筇枝，衣冠半异时。\n入城人不识，卖药俗长疑。\n饮酒难逢醉，餐松自止饥。\n华峰千嶂里，常与白云期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27771,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"熊知至","text":"岸上犹哀惧，舟中争得安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27772,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"屏山夜雪","author":"熊彦诗","text":"夜深寒妥帖，前村人断绝。\n何许小茅茨，开门满山雪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27773,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"熊彦诗","text":"湘里难为别，湘江易得秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27774,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽徐吏部 其二","author":"熊梦渭","text":"安车驾夷路，佩玉造明庭。\n天定归郎位，云开出使星。\n心尝思绿野，梦不恋青冥。\n千古行藏际，丰碑定有铭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27775,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽徐吏部 其一","author":"熊梦渭","text":"南浦簪缨盛，西山衣钵传。\n纯忱仪后进，达德迈前贤。\n静默尝闻道，安怡偶似禅。\n嗟哉游汗漫，不使侍甘泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27776,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘲时事","author":"熊朝","text":"近来西北又干戈，独立斜阳感慨多。\n雷为元城驱劫火，天胡丁谓活鲸波。\n九原难起先生死，万世其如公论何。\n道过雕峰休插竹，想逢宗老续长歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27777,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中宫院","author":"熊道裕","text":"我昨投文清泠渊，稍责老龙多睡眠。\n铁笛穿云久寂寞，作诗唤起刘高禅。\n刘高豢龙与龙语，一夜风雷共谋雨。\n雨师荷锸破天河，阿香应门觅桴鼓。\n不用栾巴西噀酒，那用出龙烦鲁叟。\n殷勤寄语望云人，高僧自是调元手。\n今朝夏抵明日秋，一夕不雨还自休。\n南陌沾濡北阡渴，东邻感激西家愁。\n安得黑云如漏卮，处处家家田作池。\n予有钵饭便可饱，雨我公田遂及私。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27778,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芙蓉","author":"熊瑞","text":"青鸾庭馆翠重重，雉扇娉婷雍万红。\n把似牡丹酣富贵，洛阳今是几秋风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27779,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和邹思道寄咏西湖","author":"熊瑞","text":"画桥杨柳不胜愁，万缕千条俛碧流。\n问著翠华霜日事，人人只道好杭州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27780,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和胡文友冷斋口号 其四","author":"熊瑞","text":"户容学屦坐常满，囊有诗篇家岂贫。\n笑我淡交寒似水，势无可热亦无嗔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27781,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和胡文友冷斋口号 其三","author":"熊瑞","text":"交情落落今如此，世事茫茫何所之。\n安得檐花清夜酌，相同郑老话襟期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27782,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和胡文友冷斋口号 其二","author":"熊瑞","text":"近来触景多生感，老去浮名祇浪誇。\n赖有风霜数丛菊，年年岁杪对黄花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27783,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和胡文友冷斋口号 其一","author":"熊瑞","text":"一声暮笛穿云裂，数点昏鸦破雨飞。\n惆怅满颠丝样白，倚门伫立望谁归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27784,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再和元夕","author":"熊瑞","text":"落梅香影放华灯，快我来寻采若盟。\n花醉羽觞金谷酒，莲开蜡炬锦官城。\n家家珠翠成群戏，处处笙箫簇队行。\n惟有天津桥上月，无人能复记新声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27785,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和王恭甫人日","author":"熊瑞","text":"缅怀阁清辉，赋诗当此日。\n盛会不复闻，手种园蔬七。\n何如采若人，观书夜至乙。\n能如子美心，托雨纪其实。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27786,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留番城","author":"熊瑞","text":"半年在家少，万事出门宽。\n酒买官酤贵，诗存俗句难。\n雨馀云影湿，秋杪雁声寒。\n今古苍茫意，斜阳独倚阑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27787,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋竹居文樽","author":"熊瑞","text":"郫筒对峙玉清圆，绝胜当年碧筒莲。\n倾酿尚侔春楚楚，开樽犹带雨涓涓。\n昔遗溪上晋六逸，今入饮中唐八仙。\n一榻青奴凉更好，醉来乘月伴高眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27788,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古梅","author":"熊瑞","text":"风度飘飘一世豪，偃然犹自外离骚。\n诸公惯作婆娑态，动说山人索价高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27789,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同刘子实游芸村","author":"熊瑞","text":"前溪后溪水泓泓，南山北山鸟嘤嘤。\n东家㩇㩇缫丝鸣，西家扑扑打麦声。\n霏霏紫萼飘红英，翘翘野菜飞蜻蜓。\n酒旗斜矗芳风轻，人在落花花里行。\n神仙古来多杳冥，刀圭入口羽翰生。\n人生快活寿百龄，何必白日求飞升。\n我今拈出芸村名，世间底处无蓬瀛。\n桃源桃源晋武陵，为我把酒酹渊明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27790,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖歌饯杨泽之回杭","author":"熊瑞","text":"謇余畴昔睹古杭，繁华不减开元唐。\n画船日日湖山堂，珠翠围绕沸笙簧。\n西湖西子斗艳妆，香车宝马桥绿杨。\n少年游冶荡春光，醉眠罗绮百花芳。\n当时湖上有平章，胡不早为计包桑。\n一朝鼙鼓动渔阳，席卷羽衣与霓裳。\n后来枉费古锦囊，感怀金铜增悲伤。\n嗟尔何知涕泪滂，身不由己心难忘。\n画阑桂树寂无香，土花惨淡月荒凉。\n绵绵此恨天何长，道逢老翁重徬徨。\n慎勿开口谈兴亡，潮生潮落钱塘江，且唱阳关举一觞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27791,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"达且同知即席索芙蓉诗","author":"熊瑞","text":"忆昔梦游芙蓉城，城中仙子千娉婷。\n霞舒云卷逞娇媚，朵朵汉家尹与邢。\n西风吹醒黄粱梦，帐暖香红谁与共。\n别来秋晚遇群仙，犹记联骖骑綵凤。\n太液池边翡翠楼，金屏绣褥何风流。\n那知镜里朱颜改，阿监青娥雪满头。\n不必对花长太息，荣华俯仰成尘迹。\n色空空色无了期，昨是今非又来日。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27792,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送黄爱梅过西湖 其一","author":"熊瑞","text":"紫牡丹开竞洛豪，春风吹面看栽桃。\n琼琚多少非初服，却笑梅花不入骚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27793,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答王山仲作墨梅来访韵","author":"熊瑞","text":"客从罗浮来，遗我一枝琼。\n仙风溢毫楮，夭矫冰雪清。\n感怀畴昔夜，醉饮月中英。\n青衣歌未竟，斗转参已横。\n俯仰今成古，散聚若为情。\n几回疏影里，呼鹤引长鸣。\n无人能悟此，空逐晓云行。\n因子重欷歔，聊以写吾生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27794,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洞仙歌 庆县宰","author":"熊德修","text":"洪崖仙裔，接武浮丘袂。\n佩玉长裾下尘世。\n东寻山水，独抱一琴来锦里。\n不犯人间宫祉。\n城山堂宇静，百丈楼高，湖海元龙浩然气。\n初度启初筵，昼永堂垂，笙鹤铿、轰出云际。\n问雅乐、何时献三雍，待汉殿明年，日长风细。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27795,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"御苑采茶歌十首 其十","author":"熊蕃","text":"外台庆历有仙官，龙凤才闻制小团。\n争得似金模寸璧，春风第一荐宸餐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27796,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"御苑采茶歌十首 其九","author":"熊蕃","text":"脩贡年年采万株，只今胜雪与初殊。\n宣和殿里春风好，喜动天颜是玉腴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27797,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"御苑采茶歌十首 其八","author":"熊蕃","text":"龙焙夕薰凝紫雾，凤池晓濯带苍烟。\n水芽只自宣和有，一洗枪旗二百年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27798,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"御苑采茶歌十首 其七","author":"熊蕃","text":"凤山日日滃非烟，剩得三春雨露天。\n棠坼浅红酣一笑，柳垂淡绿困三眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27799,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"御苑采茶歌十首 其五","author":"熊蕃","text":"红日新升气转和，翠篮相逐下层坡。\n茶官正要灵芽润，不管新来带露多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27800,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"御苑采茶歌十首 其四","author":"熊蕃","text":"纷纶争径蹂新苔，回首龙园晓色开。\n一尉鸣钲三令趣，急持烟笼下山来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27801,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"御苑采茶歌十首 其二","author":"熊蕃","text":"采采东方尚未明，玉芽同护见心诚。\n时歌一曲青山里，便是春风陌上声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27802,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"御苑采茶歌十首 其一","author":"熊蕃","text":"云腴贡使手亲调，旋放春天采玉条。\n伐鼓危亭惊晓梦，啸呼齐上苑东桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27803,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"御苑采茶歌十首 其六","author":"熊蕃","text":"翠虬新范绛纱笼，看罗春生玉节风。\n叶气云蒸千嶂绿，欢声雷震万山红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27804,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登金山","author":"熊蕃","text":"注海银成壑，浮空玉作堆。\n鳌翻三岛出，鹫驾一峰来。\n塔影波摇动，钟声潮拍回。\n犹嗟禅伯老，虚人妙高台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27805,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"熊蕃","text":"雨珠波上掷，霞锦浪中翻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27806,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"熊蕃","text":"禹凿隋穿今古利，吴樯楚楫去来空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27807,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"熊蕃","text":"僻疑昏有虎，静怪晓无鸡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27808,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"京口","author":"熊遹","text":"古郡如河内，云藏铁瓮城。\n禹疏渠绝岘，秦凿堑分京。\n旧井朱方塞，新桥渌水横。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27809,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺新郎 寿毕府判","author":"碧虚","text":"衮衮登台阁。\n问诸公、谁讲谁明，诗书礼乐。\n前日毕星光焰里，有一濂渠伊洛。\n被翠玉、江山占却。\n天下国家多少事，好人才、半刺东南角。\n当路者，欠商确。\n寿杯端拜深深酌。\n把寻常、祝颂芜词，一时删削。\n引饮莱公同鼎轴，共定澶渊一著。\n二百载、无人能学。\n文简毕公真事业，非先生之托谁之托。\n龟鹤舞，蛟龙跃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27810,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"法身颂","author":"端禅师","text":"灯心刺著石人脚，火急去请周医博。\n路逢庞公相借问，六月日头乾晒却。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27811,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句和太白水西韵","author":"管向","text":"绝景西溪寺，分明见城郭。\n绿水缬清波，青苔照朱阁。\n石径无纤尘，杨花共纷泊。\n香刹中天起，野泉当案落。\n蛇龙蟠古根，院竹翻夏箨。\n李侯金闺彦，颇多宛陵作。\n韵与金石谐，遗声寄寥廓。\n何人继其踪，佳游屡前诺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27812,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白云","author":"管师复","text":"入寺层层百级梯，野堂更与白云齐。\n平观碧落星辰近，俯见红尘世界低。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27813,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"管师复","text":"满坞白云耕不破，一潭明月钓无痕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27814,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]